behind.  If you're throwing rocks at a monster and you ran out
before the monster died, what that means is you did not bring
100+ rocks with you.  So shuttle up several dozen more and try
again.  If you can kill a priest with under 50 thrown rocks, no
monster in Sokoban will survive as many as 25.

